  "notes": [
    "May add authority (grants, writes, roles or secrets) in: intake. Auto-updates accept it; turn them off to review first.",
    "Own module, on by default, triages the whole inbox",
    "Cache reads with ETags, read from the feed, move fleet reads to the App",
    "Keep a stalled hold from overriding a refusal to push",
    "Refuse a no-op repair and never POST an empty git tree",
    "Create the vault root for any configured VAULT_DIR, not only the default",
    "Declare self_change routine fields so clients keep them",
    "A stalled hold admits the push that resumes it",
    "Engineers' pre-push self-review runs on GPT Luna",
    "Host setup changed (ops/setup.sh or ops/vm): an update runs apply only, so running the installer again may be needed (curl -fsSL https://get.aidenhq.ai | sh)."
  ],
